      "writtenOn": "2026-01-27T20:12:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Unfortunately, not at the moment.  We still support specifying an implicit queue by name, which means we can\u0027t distinguish that case from this one at config time.  If we continue the deprecation path and remove that feature, we can add that validation.",
