      "writtenOn": "2026-01-24T18:43:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "getBranchMatcher appears to be able to return None in a number of scenarios (like when a project has a single branch). If that happens we\u0027ll add a branch matcher with value None then we seem to blindly apply it matchesBranch above without checking that it has a matches() method first. \n\nI wonder if this case is worth having a test for as well as being more cautious about applying the branch matchers?",
